# Local dev / build state.
.wrangler/
.dev.vars

# NOTE: no seed file is excluded here. All four migrations are committed so that
# `wrangler d1 migrations apply` has the complete ordered set and a fresh clone
# can run `bun run verify:schema` with no extra steps.
#
# This was briefly the other way round: the 7.5 MB alert seed was gitignored on
# the theory it was reproducible from the source CSV. That was wrong twice — the
# source CSV lives under `apps/EdgeGDE - Document DB/`, which is itself
# gitignored, so CI could not regenerate it; and a gitignored 0003 would simply
# be skipped by the migration runner, leaving the alert catalog empty in
# production with no error. Correctness beats repository size.
